PI Analysis\", \"SDLC\", \"Testing (Unit/Integration/System)\"], \"summary\": \"B.Tech Computer Science graduate (2026) with hands‑on project experience across Python, SQL, and application development — from building an end‑to‑end Generative‑AI web application to designing analytics pipelines (MySQL to Power BI) processing 3,900+ records. Comfortable across the stack: writing clean Python, working with relational databases, and building simple front‑end interfaces. Quick learner, strong fundamentals, and eager to grow as a Ninja/Digital Trainee delivering reliable, well‑tested code.\", \"location\": \"Anantapur, AP\", \"projects\": [{\"name\": \"Automated Data Analyzer Using Generative AI\", \"description\": \"Built an end‑to‑end web application that lets users upload documents/datasets and get AI‑generated classification, summaries, and insights using Generative AI and NLP techniques. Implemented the Python backend (Streamlit) and a text‑preprocessing pipeline — tokenization, stop‑word removal, and normalization — to prepare unstructured data for analysis. Designed a MySQL‑backed data layer to store user accounts and processed results, and an HTML/CSS/JS front end for upload, processing, and results screens. Added an interactive Q&A feature for querying the analyzed data with Generative AI, plus a visual dashboard summarizing key insights. Collaborated with a 6‑member team through the full SDLC — requirements, UML design, implementation, and unit/integration/system testing — as the B.Tech final‑year project.\", \"technologies\": [\"Python\", \"Streamlit\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"MySQL\", \"NLP\"]}, {\"name\": \"Customer Shopping Behavior Analysis\", \"description\": \"Built an end‑to‑end analytics pipeline (MySQL → Power BI) analyzing 3,900+ customer shopping records, from raw data cleaning through executive‑ready dashboards. Performed data cleaning, preprocessing, and feature engineering in Pandas and NumPy to prepare data for analysis. Queried the database to analyze revenue trends, retention, discount impact, and subscription patterns. Built a Power BI dashboard surfacing 5+ KPIs (retention, revenue by segment, discount impact) that identified young‑adult and male customer segments as top revenue drivers.\", \"technologies\": [\"Python\", \"MySQL\", \"Power BI\", \"Pandas\", \"NumPy\"]}], \"education\": [{\"gpa\": \"7.2\", \"field\": \"Computer Science and Engineering\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology\", \"end_year\": 2026, \"start_year\": 2023, \"institution\": \"Gates Institute of Technology, Gooty\"}, {\"field\": \"Mechanical Engineering\", \"degree\": \"Diploma\", \"end_year\": 2022, \"percentage\": \"70%\", \"start_year\": 2019, \"institution\": \"Sri Krishna Devaraya Engineering College, Gooty\"}], \"full_name\": \"THARUN KAVALI\", \"experience\": [], \"certifications\": [\"Python Essentials 1 & 2 — Cisco Networking Academy\", \"Gen AI Powered Data Analytics — Tata\"], \"work_experience_years\": null}','{\"email\": \"tharunkavali003@gmail.com\", \"phone\": \"+91 8096164898\", \"full_name\": \"THARUN KAVALI\"}','Shortlisted','2026-11-16 10:24:09','Not Started',NULL,NULL,NULL),(27,1,'SIVAKUMAR KUMMARI','kumarksiva24@gmail.com','+91 8688470600','resumes/60720fb751be4cf2bba74bdbc24abc00.docx','{\"email\": \"kumarksiva24@gmail.com\", \"phone\": \"+91 8688470600\", \"skills\": [\"SQL\", \"Linux\", \"Networking (TCP/IP,DNS,DHCP,HTTP,HTTPS)\", \"VMware\", \"C Programming\", \"Java\", \"Python (Basics)\", \"MS Office Suite (Word, Excel, PowerPoint)\", \"Fast and accurate typing\", \"Time Management\", \"Active Listening\", \"Problem Solving\", \"Teamwork\", \"Self Motivating\", \"Kali Linux\", \"Nmap\", \"Wireshork\", \"Metasploit Frameworks\", \"Burpsuite\", \"Splunk\"], \"summary\": \"Self-motivated, highly passionate, and hardworking fresher seeking an opportunity to work in a challenging organization to utilize my skills and knowledge to contribute to organizational growth.\", \"location\": \"Anantapur, Andhra Pradesh\", \"projects\": [], \"education\": [\"Bachelor of Technology (ECE), A1 Global Institute of Engineering & Technology, Markapur (2022 – 2026), CGPA: 8.0\", \"Higher Secondary Education, Vignan Junior College, Pamidi (2020 – 2022), CGPA: 76.4\"], \"full_name\": \"SIVAKUMAR KUMMARI\", \"experience\": [], \"certifications\": [\"CyberSecurity – SkilLogic\", \"Internship Certificate – SkilLogic\"], \"work_experience_years\": null}','{\"email\": \"kumarksiva24@gmail.com\", \"phone\": \"+91 8688470600\", \"full_name\": \"SIVAKUMAR KUMMARI\"}','Interview Planned','2026-11-16 10:24:09','Not Started',NULL,NULL,NULL),(28,3,'ARJUN KUMAR REDDY',NULL,NULL,'resumes/e314ebd1172840fab4dbe8c43c4d3610.pdf','{\"email\": \"arjun.reddy.sample@email.com\", \"phone\": \"+91 90000 12345\", \"skills\": [\"Java\", \"SQL\", \"JavaScript\", \"Core Java\", \"JDBC\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring MVC\", \"RESTful APIs\", \"Hibernate (basics)\", \"HTML5\", \"CSS3\", \"Bootstrap 5\", \"MySQL\", \"IntelliJ IDEA\", \"Eclipse\", \"VS Code\", \"Git\", \"GitHub\", \"Postman\", \"OOP\", \"Collections\", \"Exception Handling\", \"MVC Architecture\", \"SDLC\"], \"summary\": \"Entry-level Java Full Stack Developer with hands‑on academic and personal project experience building web applications using Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, MySQL, HTML, CSS and JavaScript. Familiar with object‑oriented programming, database design, Git and debugging. Interested in joining a collaborative development team and contributing to reliable, user‑friendly applications.\", \"location\": \"Hyderabad, Telangana\", \"projects\": [{\"name\": \"Student Course Management System | Academic Project\", \"description\": \"Developed a web application to manage student records, course details and enrolments. Created REST endpoints using Java and Spring Boot for adding, viewing, updating and deleting records. Used MySQL to store student and course data and applied basic validation to incoming requests. Built responsive pages with HTML, CSS, Bootstrap and JavaScript; tested APIs using Postman.\"}, {\"name\": \"Online Book Store | Personal Project\", \"description\": \"Created a basic book catalogue with search, book details and a shopping‑cart workflow. Implemented backend services with Java, Spring Boot and Spring Data JPA. Designed MySQL tables for books, users and orders and connected the UI to backend APIs. Used Git and GitHub for version control and documented setup steps in the project README.\"}], \"education\": [\"Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech), Computer Science and Engineering, Sri Venkateswara Institute of Technology, Anantapur, Andhra Pradesh, 2022 – 2026, CGPA: 8.1/10\", \"Intermediate (MPC), Narayana Junior College, Anantapur, Andhra Pradesh, 2020 – 2022, 86%\"], \"full_name\": \"ARJUN KUMAR REDDY\", \"experience\": [], \"certifications\": [\"Java Programming Fundamentals – NPTEL (Course Completion)\", \"SQL and Relational Databases – Great Learning (Online Course)\"], \"work_experience_years\": null}','null','New','2026-11-17 05:11:13','Not Started',NULL,NULL,NULL),(29,1,'V MANOJKUMAR REDDY','manojkumarreddym534@gmail.com','+91 7981601803','resumes/f5d87393f1d34454b055d4dadc30e4ce.pdf','{\"email\": \"manojkumarreddym534@gmail.com\", \"phone\": \"+91 7981601803\", \"skills\": [\"Python\", \"HTML5\", \"CSS\", \"MySQL\", \"NumPy\", \"Pandas\", \"Matplotlib\", \"Excel\", \"Jupyter Notebook\", \"PyCharm\"], \"summary\": \"To obtain an entry-level position as a Python Developer or Data Analyst where I can apply my knowledge of Python, MySQL, NumPy, and Pandas to develop efficient solutions and analyze data. Eager to utilize my problem-solving and analytical skills to contribute to organizational growth while gaining practical industry experience and continuously enhancing my technical expertise.\", \"location\": null, \"projects\": [\"Toyota Used Car Sales Data Analysis | Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn\"], \"education\": [\"Bachelor of Science (B.Sc) in Computer Science